{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586200/extras/11.png?t=1744347776\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Having inherited the will of your late master, after years of research...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You finally succeed in creating a homunculus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is accomplished\u2014now all that\u2019s left is to hand it over to the government. There\u2019s no longer any reason to live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or so you thought...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thus begins your life with the homunculus\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586200/extras/22.png?t=1744347776\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A homunculus-raising simulation game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While talking with the homunculus, you teach her about daily life and the world. Her personality changes depending on your actions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take walks together, earn money through part-time jobs, and enjoy crafting through alchemy\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">this is a raising game where you can experience many things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586200/extras/33.png?t=1744347776\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Live2D</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teach a cute and innocent homunculus!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The girl\u2019s personality changes based on your actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A warm, pure love story</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3586200?t=1744347776","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/358620